        <body>
            <div xml:id="d711">

                <pb facs="0704" n="1438" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1438"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-01"><hi rendition="#italic">January 1, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received Jan. 17.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 751.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that a
                    telegram, just received from Consul Jewett at Sivas, informs me that he has left
                    Sivas for Marsovan.</p>
                <p>The apprehension of a renewed massacre which prevented him several days ago from
                    going under my telegraphic order to Marsovan, temporarily, on the application of
                    missionaries here, no longer exists, I presume, at Sivas.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
